# Project Index

Hugo static site — **Enterprise Knowledge Hub** (~900 pages). **Do not scan the full repo.**

## Start Here

| Doc | When to read |
|-----|--------------|
| `AGENTS.md` | Any task — routing table + build commands |
| `docs/ai-index/SECTION-REGISTRY.md` | Find which section/file to edit |
| `docs/ai-index/ARCHITECTURE.md` | Layouts, shortcodes, navigation wiring |

## Section → Rule

| Section | Rule file |
|---------|-----------|
| New section registration | `curriculum-sections.mdc` |
| dsa-coding | `dsa-coding-posts.mdc` |
| design-patterns | `lld-posts.mdc` |
| system-design | `system-design-posts.mdc` |
| microservices | `microservices-posts.mdc` |
| Cheat-sheet handbooks | `cheatsheet-template.mdc` (+ `java-cheatsheet-posts.mdc`, `spring-boot-handbook-posts.mdc`, `engineering-handbook-cheatsheets.mdc`) |

## Key Config (edit nav here, not layouts)

- `data/curriculum_sections.yaml` — home + header sections
- `data/curriculum_sidebar.yaml` — per-section modules/order keys
- `data/<section>_modules.yaml` + `data/<section>_order.yaml` — TOC + prev/next

## Regenerate Index

```bash
python scripts/generate_ai_index.py
```
